<title>MALAYSIA: SQUASH-WOMEN'S WORLD OPEN THIRD ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-WOMEN'S WORLD OPEN THIRD ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PETALING JAYA, Malaysia 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third round</p>
<p>results in the women's World Open squash tournament on Thursday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Michelle Martin (Australia) beat Tracey Shenton (England) 9-1</p>
<p>9-0 9-0</p>
<p>5-Liz Irving (Australia) beat 16-Meeghan Bell (Australia) 9-3</p>
<p>9-3 9-6</p>
<p>4-Cassie Jackman (England) beat 11-Claire Nitch (South Africa)</p>
<p>9-3 9-5 9-0</p>
<p>8-Sabine Schone (Germany) beat 14-Leilani Marsh (New Zealand)</p>
<p>10-8 2-9 9-5 7-9 9-2</p>
<p>6-Carol Owens (Australia) beat 15-Linda Charman (England) 9-4</p>
<p>9-1 9-5</p>
<p>2-Sarah Fitz-Gerald (Australia) beat Philippa Beams (New</p>
<p>Zealand) 9-3 9-3 9-2</p>
<p>7-Sue Wright (England) beat 9-Fiona Geaves (England) 6-9 9-2</p>
<p>9-1 9-0</p>
<p>3-Suzanne Horner (England) beat 12-Robyn Cooper (Australia) 9-6</p>
<p>4-9 10-9 9-4</p>
</text>
